'''Sean Williams''' (born [[September 13]], [[1986]] in [[Houston, Texas]]) is an [[United States|American]] [[basketball]] player who attended [[Boston College]]. He is a 6'10" forward/center and a highly athletic shot blocker. 

Williams was dismissed from the team during his junior year.. He had been suspended twice during his 3 year college basketball career already. When he was suspended from Boston College for one semester during his sophomore year, Williams took classes at the [[University of Houston]]. 

